1
00:00:00,526 --> 00:00:01,856
[RAJESH GRUNTS]

2
00:00:09,202 --> 00:00:11,832
I've done it. I've won.

3
00:00:11,996 --> 00:00:14,536
(Sheldon:)The ring is mine.

4
00:00:14,707 --> 00:00:16,287
(Sheldon:)It's mine!

5
00:00:22,173 --> 00:00:26,093
(Sheldon:)We're going to clean it up
and make it pretty.

6
00:00:27,136 --> 00:00:30,386
(Sheldon:)My own, my love...

7
00:00:36,020 --> 00:00:37,270
[SCREAMS]

8
00:00:37,438 --> 00:00:38,858
[SCREAMS]

9
00:00:41,984 --> 00:00:43,824
(Leonard:)Where's the ring?

10
00:00:43,986 --> 00:00:47,116
(Leonard:)It's in a FedEx box on its way back
to where it came from.

11
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:50,280
(Raj:)The fires of Mount Doom?

12
00:00:50,952 --> 00:00:54,122
(Leonard:)Peter Jackson's office in New Zealand.
It wasn't ours.

13
00:00:54,288 --> 00:00:56,918
(Howard:)You quit the game.
You had no right to take it.

14
00:00:57,083 --> 00:01:00,623
You guys were sleeping. The ring was
on the floor. No one was touching it.

